<section class="section services"><div class="wrap faq-grid"><div class="faq-intro"><div class="eyebrow">Before you get started</div><h2>Practical questions.<br>Clear answers.</h2></div><div class="faq-list"><details><summary>Can an AI assistant make mistakes?</summary><p>Yes. We plan for that with a limited scope, approved information, representative testing, and human handoffs. Sensitive decisions and commitments should stay with authorized people.</p></details><details><summary>Can it schedule appointments?</summary><p>That depends on the scheduling tool, available integration, and permissions. We confirm whether it can check availability and create bookings safely before including that capability in the scope.</p></details><details><summary>What information does an assistant need?</summary><p>Only the information necessary for its defined role. We review source quality, access rules, and how updates will be maintained. We also discuss what information should remain outside the assistant.</p></details><details><summary>Do we need to replace our whole website?</summary><p>Usually the first question is whether your current website and tools support the intended integration. We evaluate that before proposing any platform changes.</p></details></div></div></section><div style="height:70px" aria-hidden="true"></div><section class="contact-section" id="contact"><div class="wrap"><div class="contact-panel"><div><div class="eyebrow">Let’s make your next step simple</div><h2 data-reveal="words">A better business<br>starts with a conversation.</h2><p>Tell us where work gets stuck. We’ll start with a free assessment and find the first useful step for your business.</p></div><div class="contact-actions"><a class="button" href="mailto:jesse@simpleten.ai?subject=SimpleTen%20business%20assessment&amp;body=Hi%20Jesse%2C%0A%0AI%20would%20like%20to%20discuss%20a%20Service%20Business%20Blueprint.%0A%0ABusiness%20name%3A%0AWebsite%3A%0ACity%3A%0AThe%20process%20I%20would%20most%20li